      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3414c52c-5796-50fe-b18e-d35b8e86572e"))
  (text "AVDD + DOVDD 2.8 V (as ESP32-S3-EYE); DVDD 1.2 V (OV2640 datasheet core 1.14-1.26 V; the S3-EYE uses 1.5 V -"
    (at 15.24 36.68 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "04afa274-9ad2-541f-84d7-be0024fd2133"))
  (text "conflict noted, G2 check against the purchased module). Rails are always on with 3V3 (D-049); PWDN (pulled high)"
    (at 15.24 39.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e156c203-fbd8-53c8-922d-406a0909dd36"))
  (text "keeps the sensor in standby. SCCB is on the main 3.3 V I2C bus (as on the S3-EYE) - level margin is a G2 check."
    (at 15.24 43.08 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dca21c8d-4c0e-5c1a-b07c-9a1a60715108"))
